            <ArticleTitle>The efficacy and safety of ketoprofen in postsurgical dental pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>234, 236, 238 passim</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Ketoprofen is a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug with both anti-inflammatory and analgesic properties. This paper will review the efficacy and safety of ketoprofen in patients experiencing pain after the surgical removal of impacted third molar teeth.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
